---
description: Entmoot format naming and compatibility
alwaysApply: true
---

Entmoot-owned format, policy and storage series stay `v1` until the repository
move. Fingerprints distinguish incompatible implementations at storage and
artifact boundaries; do not silently read an incompatible layout or reset data.
Remove obsolete modes instead of aliasing them. External tool/standard versions
keep their actual names. See [AGENTS](../../AGENTS.md).
